          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/26/01/010" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">26.01.010 Title.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>This Title is known as Title 26, Electrical Regulations and will be referred to in this Title as “this Title.”</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-eff12649bfa7ceb13ec0654a5b7c44197e803b1f4d8a78a2ed75f6b0034cf846">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>
<div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_sections js-view-dom-id-4225cab91decbb3ecfd0fccfea748a10a8c7cd266c8f06ab6b3b69f87d3f262f">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>

</div>

    </div>
          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/26/01/020" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">26.01.020 Purpose.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>The purpose of this Title is to provide minimum standards to safeguard life or limb, health, property, and public welfare by regulating and controlling the design, construction, installation, quality of materials, location, operation and maintenance of all electrical systems within the City’s area of regulatory responsibility.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-b43c92b682e08a8248d8a85d64768039788b7263a23c35e229bc706616db3c5e">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>
<div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_sections js-view-dom-id-16d87a4c55190ddd54ca20409b016bd3ba6df4b674dfea889e6ba45846a4de1f">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>

</div>

    </div>
          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/26/01/030" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">26.01.030  Code Adoption.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-prefix-note field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p>(Amended by Ordinance 192117, effective November 21, 2025.)</p></div></div>



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>Except as otherwise provided in this code, theOregon Electrical Specialty Code(OESC) as adopted by OAR 918-305-0100 and amended by 918-305-0105 is adopted by this reference.</span></p><p><span>This Title will prevail except where specifically prohibited by the Oregon Revised Statutes and the Oregon Administrative Rules.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-1eee5fde7a36517299b6246dc3a7f26f953093cff818cda8090402df18653bfc">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>
<div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_sections js-view-dom-id-48f3919ba7b0686633ae5867a6d8eee110f7cc8f8d4a0c1cd6fd9fc88c0184c8">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>

</div>

    </div>
  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>

</div>
</span></div>
    </div>
          <div class="views-row">
