<div class="node--embedded">
    <h2>
        <a href="/code/26/02" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Chapter 26.02  Definitions</span>
</a>
    </h2>
    <div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-f84aeef48144c03419ca879482bb4694d48f5ae6d1813e8f0c895ca6da4287be">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>
<div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_sections js-view-dom-id-50b906d40fb78a6ab0726e5e0a517431d39fd5994614c6d0375a2e3e918f8e51">
  
    

  
  

          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/26/02/010" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">26.02.010 General.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>For the purpose of this Title, certain terms, phrases, words, and their derivatives must be construed as specified in this Chapter. Words used in the singular include the plural and the singular. Words used in the masculine gender include the feminine and the feminine the masculine. Terms, words, phrases and their derivatives used in this Title but not specifically defined in this Chapter have the meanings commonly accepted in the community.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-0f3409b2e97a22a35d24ccbae590ca9a5661510710486235f2b2714ffe900c97">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>
