<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/26/02/120" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">26.02.120 Supervising Electrician.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span><strong>Supervising Electrician</strong> is a person possessing a valid general or limited supervising electrician’s license issued by the State of Oregon.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
